'      body = max(body, smoothstep(0.0, 1.5, tw - length(dk)) * smoothstep(0.85, 1.6, hk + (fn - 0.5) * (cal ? 0.35 : 0.9) + (lob - 0.5) * (cal ? 0.15 : 0.7)) * smoothstep(tk + 0.6, tk - 0.8, hk));   /* a ragged base, not a ruler line (user 11-24: "would you improve the bottom") */',
